; Neonmancer push motifs: small original patterns that only work under the
; game's rules (no jump, D272: crates plug holes, fall off ledges and
; stack). Each is solved with scripts/solve.mjs; the numbers are its
; output. Characters: see xsb.mjs.
; Copy the idea, not the cells: a room sets it in its own shape.

; Bridge and weight: the plate lies past a row of holes a crate can't
; cross. The trick: plug the hole in the plate's own column, then the
; second crate rolls over the first. Plugging any other column
; spends a crate for nothing. 8 pushes, 2 sharp steps, 86% traps (solve.mjs).
